{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#card-zh","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-odoo 是一个把 Odoo 业务数据接入 DeepSeek Harness 的工具插件，通过 JSON-RPC 连接用户配置的 Odoo 服务，并向 Harness 注册服务器信息、模型字段说明和受限记录查询工具。它可查看联系人、产品、销售订单、采购订单、发票、项目、商机与库存等白名单模型，按条件筛选并返回记录；还可在显式开启后创建销售订单或项目任务草稿。查询结果有字段、分页与响应大小限制，适合希望让 agent 读取 ERP 数据或准备有限草稿的团队。使用时需配置 Odoo 地址、数据库、用户名及 API key 或密码。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:54-59","src/tools.ts:27-40","src/models.ts:1-26","src/config.ts:36-58"]}
{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#card-en","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-odoo connects DeepSeek Harness to Odoo through JSON-RPC tools for server details, model fields, and allow-listed ERP searches. Results have field and page limits. With allowWrite enabled, it creates draft orders and tasks. Requires an Odoo URL, database, username, and API key or password.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:54-59","src/tools.ts:27-40","src/models.ts:1-26","src/config.ts:36-58"]}
