{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#feature-1","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-odoo 的功能「查询白名单业务记录」：调用 odoo_search_read，按模型、domain、字段、排序及分页参数查询 Odoo 记录，返回匹配总数和结果；模型和字段范围受到代码中的限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:72-111","src/client.ts:111-153"]}
{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#feature-2","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-odoo 的功能「查看模型字段」：调用 odoo_describe_model 获取白名单模型的字段元数据，供后续查询了解字段名称、类型及选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:54-69","src/client.ts:87-109"]}
{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#feature-3","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-odoo 的功能「读取服务器信息」：调用 odoo_server_info 获取连接实例的版本、协议版本及当前认证用户 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:43-52","src/client.ts:66-85"]}
{"unit_id":"maxmilian__dsh-odoo#feature-4","repo":"maxmilian/dsh-odoo","commit":"ace35f23fedc86081bef06de79867be96026e8ae","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-odoo 的功能「创建受限草稿」：启用 allowWrite 后调用 odoo_create_draft，可为 sale.order 或 project.task 创建草稿；输入字段经过白名单校验，创建后读取记录摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:114-137","src/client.ts:155-195"]}
